    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βου-δόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flaying oxen, galling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				504
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούδορα</span> codd., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουδόρα</span> Sch.T.ll.<i><span class="en">
				17.550
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1117.53
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>for flaying</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχαιρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					97.7
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> prov.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. νόμῳ</span> of those who deserve
			flaying, <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				3.66
			</span></i>.</div>
